{
 "about": "The cast: open-licence portraits for the people inside product screens (a commenter, a customer, a teammate, a channel owner). Each is a Burst photo (Shopify's free stock photos; licence \"Burst Some Rights Reserved\": free for commercial use, no credit needed; never sold as a file, never compiled into a similar collection; recognisable people stay in a good light and never endorse anything by name). scripts/content.mjs downloads the ones a film casts from the CDN, crops each to its face (crop: x, y, side as shares of the photo's width and height) into public/people/<id>.jpg at 512 px, and writes the licence record into assets/licences.json. p: how the person presents (it picks a fitting first name); age: adult or older. A person in a screen is a user of the product, never a named testimonial or a quote presented as real.",
